evid=pagehead(root,'Evidence','Let the work <span class="serif highlight">speak.</span>','A selection of awards, campaign milestones, community growth and learner feedback.')+f'''<section class="section container evidence-collection"><div class="proof-manifest"><div><span class="eyebrow">Selected highlights</span><h2>Recognition, results and <span class="serif highlight">real communities.</span></h2><p>A closer look at the campaigns, communities and recognition behind my work.</p></div><div class="proof-manifest-aside"><strong>11</strong><span>Career highlights</span><small>Awards · Campaigns · Communities</small></div></div><div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter evidence"><button type="button" class="filter" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All evidence</button><button type="button" class="filter" data-filter="recognition" aria-pressed="false">Recognition</button><button type="button" class="filter" data-filter="campaign" aria-pressed="false">Campaigns</button><button type="button" class="filter" data-filter="community" aria-pressed="false">Communities</button><button type="button" class="filter" data-filter="coaching" aria-pressed="false">Learning & feedback</button></div><p class="proof-filter-status" aria-live="polite" data-filter-status>Showing 11 pieces of evidence</p><div class="evidence-grid" id="evidence-gallery">{cards}</div><div class="evidence-action"><div><strong>More work, more proof.</strong><p>New milestones and community stories to come.</p></div><a href="../evidence/studio/" class="btn btn-ghost">Evidence Studio ↗</a></div><dialog id="proof-lightbox" class="lightbox" aria-label="Evidence image"><button type="button" class="close" data-close aria-label="Close image">×</button><div class="lightbox-inner"><img alt="Expanded evidence"></div></dialog></section>'''
studio='<section class="page-head"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="../../">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="../">Evidence</a><span>/</span><span>Studio</span></div><div class="page-kicker">EVIDENCE WORKFLOW</div><h1>Keep your proof <span class="serif highlight">organized.</span></h1><p>Prepare an approved screenshot and its metadata for the portfolio. Everything runs in your browser; no evidence is silently uploaded or shared.</p></div></section><section class="section container studio-grid"><article class="studio-panel"><div class="eyebrow">Step 01 / Choose a screenshot</div><div class="upload-zone" id="evidence-upload-zone"><input type="file" id="new-evidence-file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" aria-label="Select evidence screenshot"><strong>Drop a screenshot here or browse</strong><span>PNG, JPEG or WebP · Max 12 MB · Avoid account numbers and other people\'s names</span></div><div class="studio-preview" id="studio-preview" hidden><img id="studio-image" alt="Evidence preview"></div><div class="eyebrow studio-label">Step 02 / Describe what it shows</div><div class="studio-fields"><label>Title<input id="studio-title" placeholder="e.g. Telegram community — November 2026" maxlength="90"></label><label>Category<select id="studio-category"><option value="community">Community</option><option value="recognition">Recognition</option><option value="campaign">Campaign</option><option value="coaching">Learning & feedback</option></select></label><label>Description<textarea id="studio-description" rows="4" maxlength="300" placeholder="Describe only what the screenshot actually shows."></textarea></label><label>Evidence date <input id="studio-date" type="date"></label></div><button type="button" id="studio-export" class="btn btn-primary">Prepare image and JSON ↗</button><p class="copy-note" id="studio-status" role="status"></p><div id="studio-results" hidden><a id="studio-image-download" class="btn btn-ghost" download>Download optimized image ↓</a><a id="studio-json-download" class="btn btn-ghost" download>Download entry JSON ↓</a></div></article><aside class="studio-guide"><div class="eyebrow">Step 03 / Publish through GitHub</div><h3>A review-first evidence library.</h3><p>The Evidence Studio prepares an optimized image and a JSON record for review. It does not publish directly, because public, unauthenticated uploads would put this portfolio and visitors at risk.</p><ol><li>Prepare an image that Muneerah has permission to publish. Blur payment details, identifying third-party messages and sensitive information first.</li><li>Download the optimized image and JSON entry. Upload the image into <code>assets/media/</code> of the official repository.</li><li>Add the JSON object to <code>data/evidence.json</code> and commit the changes.</li><li>The Git-linked deployment automatically updates the gallery after Vercel finishes building.</li></ol><a href="https://github.com/NomadDigita/muneerah-portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-ghost">Open portfolio repository ↗</a><a href="../" class="btn btn-quiet">Back to evidence gallery ↗</a></aside></section>'
shell('evidence/studio/','Evidence Studio','Prepare images and metadata locally for GitHub-reviewed updates.',studio,active='evidence/')
shell('evidence/','Evidence & Recognition','A curated portfolio evidence library: LearnerFlex recognition, sales dashboard and community growth snapshots.',evid,active='evidence/')

